[OPTIONS]
.DEScale = 0.0105
.RStop = 6
.SIPow = 2
.Version = 9
.Double AddValue = 0.1
.Double Lenght = 2.5
.Double Scale = 2
.Double v_Lp_space = 2
[SOURCE]
procedure BaguaboxP(var x, y, z, w: Double; PIteration3D: TPIteration3D);
var

temp, modulus, negativeLenght, invPower : double;
intPow : integer;

begin


//===modulus==in==Lp========()==================================
/// calculate radius in Lp space where circle is circle (2), square (1) or smartphone shape (4)
// Using just int values - faster.

intPow:=round(v_Lp_space);

	if intPow = 1 then  
	// choice 1. If curvatures is 1 then use fastest formula
	begin
	modulus  := abs(x) + abs(y) + abs(z);
	end
		
  		else if intPow = 2 then  
		// choice2. If curvatures is 2 then use standart formula
	  	begin
		modulus  := sqrt( x*x + y*y + z*z);
		end
		
		else  
		//choice 3. else use heavy formulas
	begin
	invPower:= 1/ intPow; 
	temp:= intPower(abs(x),intPow) + intPower(abs(y),intPow) + intPower(abs(z),intPow);
	modulus  := power( temp ,invPower);
		end;



//====baguafold=======(^^)==========================
//baguafold, positive version
// In transformation  unit vector is involved.

// Zvector = Baguafold(Zvector)


//optimisation for speed
negativeLenght:= -Lenght;


 // to awoyd division / 0; Not necessary in M3D but still benefitial
 if modulus = 0 then
    begin
      modulus := 1e-15;
   end;




///=========x=====================(^_^)===== 
	 if x > Lenght then
	    begin
		x := x/modulus + AddValue;
	    end
	  else if x < negativeLenght then
	    begin
		x := x/modulus - AddValue;
	   end
	  else
	    begin
	//walk along
	    end;

///=========y==========================
	 if y > Lenght then
	    begin
		y := y/modulus + AddValue;
	    end
	  else if y < negativeLenght then
	    begin
		y := y/modulus - AddValue;
	   end
	  else
	    begin
	//walk along
	    end;

///=========z==========================
	 if x > Lenght then
	    begin
		z := z/modulus + AddValue;
	    end
	  else if z < negativeLenght then
	    begin
		z := z/modulus - AddValue;
	   end
	  else
	    begin
	//walk along
	    end;






//=====scale==+C==========================================
//scaling and +C
// Zvector = Scale*Zvector + C
  x := x*scale + PIteration3D^.J1;
  y := y*scale + PIteration3D^.J2;
  z := z*scale + PIteration3D^.J3;





end;
[END]
Formula version 1.4

Positive fold baguabox.

Very different ...box like formula.

On hybridisation watch to the bailout value. Stature depends on bailout, by default here "R bailout" = 6. Value 16 can turn fractal into just single inside.

Formula variables:
Lenght - like Fold, AddValue - adds inside a fold. Scale 


In Lp space circle (if p=2) is circle, (if p=1) diamond or (if p=4) a smartphone shape
sophistication 1<2<4  but speed 1>>2>>4


